# Forget Me Not (WotG 42) from Rolanberry Fields, the four Large Memory Fragments held: the Cavernous Maw plays 503 [1,
# 26, 0, 6912, 235686, 1205, 183377, 1]; its finish sets Status 1 and Option 110, and the next tick shows the set-down
# at 800 71.839 770 rot 63 in Grauberg [S]. The login there at Status 1 plays the zone-in 33, left open; the update with
# option 0 sends no update packet; the finish sets Status 2 and xi.maws.goToMaw sends the char to xi.maws.pastMaws[110]:
# the next tick shows Rolanberry Fields [S] at -196.5 7.999 361.192 rot 225. The login there at Status 2 completes the
# mission (Pillar of Hope current) and takes the four fragments (xi.wotg.helpers.removeMemoryFragments).
lists RolanberryFields/Cavernous_Maw/onTrigger RolanberryFields/onEventFinish/503 GraubergS/onZoneIn/1 GraubergS/onEventUpdate/33 GraubergS/onEventFinish/33 RolanberryFieldsS/onZoneIn/1
char zone=RolanberryFields pos=-198,8,361 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Wotg ForgetMeNot current
keyitem LargeMemoryFragment1
keyitem LargeMemoryFragment2
keyitem LargeMemoryFragment3
keyitem LargeMemoryFragment4
login
trigger Cavernous_Maw                      # 503
finish                                     # Status 1, Option the zone; set down in Grauberg [S]
tick 400
login open                                 # Status 1: 33
update 33 option=0                         # not 1: no update packet
finish                                     # Status 2; goToMaw: the maw's other side
tick 400
login                                      # Status 2: completed, the fragments removed
